ess of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/aperitivo\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/aperitivo\">aperitivo<\/a>. Whether you enjoy them neat or mixed in <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktails<\/a> - these are the perfect accompaniment for any occasion or flavour, and sure to be a crowd pleaser!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_ajAkeC","text_fLRQPV"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SommersortenHero_Mobil_UK.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"large","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"multicolumn_MJr4xh":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_zzPLzT":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Copyof3er_Set_700_Oben_UK.jpg","title":"Set of 3","text":"<p>Our exclusive <a href=\"\/products\/set3-700\" title=\"Set of 3 Moonshine Jars (700ml)\">set of 3<\/a> with three 700ml Jars! In this set, you can create any flavour combination you wish, including our summer varieties! As a bonus, you'll get three free <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">pourers<\/a> included. Perfect for anyone craving a refreshing summer treat or is looking for a special gift for their loved ones.<\/p>","mobile_text":"","link_label":"Buy now","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/set3-700","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":true}},"column_P4MzjR":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SommerMinis_Front_UK_1_1.jpg","title":"Summer Mini Set","text":"<p>The O'Donnell Moonshine Summer Minis - the ideal gift or the perfect way to try a variety of our summer flavours! The Summer Minis consist of four different Mini O'Donnell Moonshine Shots (50ml each) with the fruity flavours <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\">Passion Fruit<\/a>, <a href=\"\/products\/very-cherry\" title=\"Very Cherry\">Very Cherry<\/a>, <a href=\"\/products\/wild-berry\" title=\"Wild Berry\">Wild Berry<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\">Blood Orange<\/a>.<\/p>","mobile_text":"","link_label":"Buy now","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/set-of-mini-moonshine-jars-4x50ml","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":true}},"column_GgNEJA":{"type":"column","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Micros_8erBox_Sommer_Mood_D_1.jpg","title":"Summer Micro Moonshine Box","text":"<p>A selection of refreshing summer flavours to enjoy in miniature size! This set contains eight O'Donnell Micro Shots (20ml each) with a variety of delicious flavours: 2x <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\">Passion Fruit<\/a>, 2x <a href=\"\/products\/very-cherry\" title=\"Very Cherry\">Very Cherry<\/a>, 2x <a href=\"\/products\/wild-berry\" title=\"Wild Berry\">Wild Berry<\/a> and 2x <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\">Blood Orange<\/a>. Perfect for summer occasions or simply to discover new flavours.<\/p>","mobile_text":"","link_label":"Buy now","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/micro-box-8","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":true}},"column_mxYQLi":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GiftBox_Oben_UK_1_4.jpg","title":"Gift Box of 2","text":"<p>Discover our exquisite summer flavours, <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/blood-orange\">Blood Orange<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/passionfruit\">Passion Fruit<\/a> in a stylish 2-pack gift box! The perfect gift for anyone who loves summer. Packaged in an elegant box with shot glasses and <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">pourer<\/a>, they are ideal for giving as a gift or enjoying yourself.<\/p>","mobile_text":"","link_label":"Buy now","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/giftset","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":true}}},"block_order":["column_zzPLzT","column_P4MzjR","column_GgNEJA","column_mxYQLi"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"title":"Perfect as a gift!","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_WFLp3Y":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_GtTY6d":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Our cocktails","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_er3hm3":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Of course you can also enjoy our summer varieties in delicious cocktails! Mix yourself a refreshing <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\/passion-fruit-spritz\" title=\"Passion Fruit Spritz\">Passion Fruit Spritz<\/a>, a fruity <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\/blood-orange-mojito\" title=\"Blood Orange Mojito\">Blood Orange Mojito<\/a> or an aromatic <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\/summer-negroni\" title=\"Summer Negroni\">Summer Negroni<\/a> and experience summer in all its splendour. The versatile flavours of our summer varieties give every cocktail a special touch and make them a real highlight for your next summer party!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_GLiKLc":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"More cocktails","button_link":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/cocktails","button_style_white